* "sample.library"
* An FD file for the FD tests: the cases of the conversion to SFD
* (bad_lib.fd has the errors)
##base _SampleBase
##bias 30
* Before ##public: public with a prototype, private without
SampleFirst(a)(d0)
SampleReserved()()
##public
* Plain calls, one ending with a ';'
SampleAdd(a,b)(d0,d1)
SampleFind(list,name)(a0,a1);
* Tag lists, with varargs versions named after them
SampleOpenA(name,tags)(a0,a1)
SampleCreateTagList(tags)(a0)
SampleNew(tags)(a1)
* A varargs version named in the table of exceptions
VPrintf(format,args)(d1,d2)
* Pointers to functions
SampleHook(hook,data)(a0,a1)
SampleFree(data,freefunc)(a0,a1)
* A double, in two registers
SampleScale(value,factor)(d0/d1,d2)
##bias 90
* A gap in the offsets
SampleLater()()
* dos.library aliases
System(command,tags)(d1,d2)
* DoPkt() and DoPkt0() to DoPkt4()
DoPkt(port,action,arg1,arg2,arg3,arg4,arg5)(d1,d2,d3,d4,d5,d6,d7)
* An array argument, and a type from a typedef
SampleName(buffer,id)(a0,d0)
##private
SamplePrivate(a)(d0)
SamplePrivateNoProto(a)(d0)
##end
